Job description
We are looking for a project manager to join the Business Strategy and Project Management (BSPM) division to strengthen the European Stability Mechanism’s (ESM) artificial intelligence (AI) capabilities and contribute to a broader portfolio of strategic and business change initiatives. The division leads strategy implementation and business change through analysis, disciplined project execution, and quality management to help achieve corporate goals.
In this role, you will initially focus on leading AI projects. This includes working closely with business divisions to identify, shape, and implement AI-driven solutions that enhance efficiency and impact across the ESM and drive the adoption of AI solutions and new ways of working. This role sits at the intersection of project delivery and innovation, offering a unique opportunity to shape how AI transforms an international financial institution.
