Manage end-to-end project lifecycles (initiation to closure), applying appropriate delivery methodologies (traditional and/or Lean-Agile);
Define business needs, scope, timelines, resources, risks, and deliverables;
Ensure effective stakeholder engagement and alignment with organisational objectives;
