We are looking for an experienced Legal Counsel to strengthen the Commercial Legal and Procurement team of the European Stability Mechanism (ESM). The team’s mission is to ensure the ESM has the facilities, goods, and services it needs to deliver on its mandate, in line with the institution’s procurement and outsourcing policies. This position involves, among other things, drafting, reviewing, and negotiating commercial contracts and providing legal advice on the ESM procurement policy and its procedures, as well as providing legal advice on the drafting of procurement-related documents.
