Work experience related to strategy formulation in international financial/development institutions, government agencies, multinational firms, or financial institutions, including formulation, design, implementation, and policy preparation;
Experience with macroeconomic and microeconomic analysis of regional, country, and sector developments and programs;
Experience in the region of the BSTDB’s operations and experience in an international or local development financial institution, or a BSTDB Member Government agency;
